items.translit:
La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer;

Subhanallah, walhamdulillah, wa la ilaha illallah, wallahu akbar;

Wala hawla wala quwwata illa billahil-‘aliyyil-‘azim;

Rabbighfir li.

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi ‘afani fi jasadi;

Wa radda ‘alayya ruhi;

Wa adhina li bidhikrih.
